{"id":"651005","name":"潮汕桅粽","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/651005/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"桅","amount":"33g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"桅备用。","img":"images/651005/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"碗中加入桅。","img":"images/651005/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入温水搅拌融化。","img":"images/651005/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"盆中倒入糯米粉。","img":"images/651005/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入拌匀的桅水。","img":"images/651005/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀至无干粉，面糊呈滴落状态。","img":"images/651005/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量花生油。","img":"images/651005/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"继续搅拌，搅拌至粉浆和油充分融合。","img":"images/651005/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"模具均匀刷上花生油。","img":"images/651005/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"粉浆倒入模具中轻震几下，锅中水烧开，大火蒸1个半小时左右。","img":"images/651005/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"出炉晾凉脱模即可食用。","img":"images/651005/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品晾凉即可。","img":"images/651005/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品（脱模沾白糖）。","img":"images/651005/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/651005/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/651005/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}